title: Paul Levi
is-pinned-card: true
tags: advisor, left
card-image: img/portraits/LeviPaul.jpg
view-if: levi_advisor = 1
new-page: true 

= Paul Levi

Levi is [? if chancellor = "Levi": the current Chancellor and ?][? if president = "Levi": the current President and ?] a former leader of the [+ uspd_name +] who left over their devotion to violence and revolutionary adventurism.

- @building_the_left
- @uspd_cooperation
- @chancellor
- @president
- @root: Return to main

@building_the_left
title: Building the Left
subtitle: Push the SPD to the left.
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; left_strength += 10; left_dissent -= 8; reformist_dissent += 3

We have increased the strength of the left faction with the SPD. This raised concern among the moderate reformists in the party.

@uspd_cooperation
title: Cooperation with the [+ uspd_name +]
subtitle: Any cooperation between the parties requires compromise from the [+ uspd_name +] as well as the SPD.
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; left_strength += 5; uspd_relation += 6*(1-dissent); reformist_dissent += 3; communist_coalition += 1 if uspd_cooperation_seen <= 1; uspd_cooperation_seen += 1

Levi attempts to reach out to his former colleagues to dissuade the [+ uspd_name +] from their current extreme path. Some concessions are extracted.

@chancellor
title: Use the Chancellorship
subtitle: As the current Chancellor, Levi can make use of their position to further our goals.
view-if: chancellor == "Levi"
choose-if: advisor_action_timer == 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
go-to: chancellor

@president
title: Use the Presidency
subtitle: As the current President, Levi can make use of their position to further our goals.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer == 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
view if: president == "Levi"

- @article_48: We can use Article 48!
- @military_relations: We can improve our relations with the Reichswehr.
- @on_the_world_stage: We can improve our relations on the world stage.
- @presidential_snap_election: We can call snap elections!
- @reichsexecution: We can order a Reichsexekution!

@article_48
choose-if: chancellor_party == "SPD" and not presidential_powers and article_48_timer <= 8 and judicial_reform >= 3 and ((neorevisionist_strength+left_strength+unemployed >= 50) or in_emergency_government)
unavailable-subtitle: [? if judicial_reform < 3 : The reactionary judiciary would strike them down as unconstitutional. ?][? if neorevisionist_strength+left_strength+unemployed < 50 : The party views these decrees as unecessary. ?][? if article_48_timer > 8 : [+ article_48_timer +] months before we can next take this action. ?]
go-to: article_48

@military_relations
view-if: not victory_republic
choose-if: military_relations_timer <= 0
unavailable-subtitle: [+ military_relations_timer +] months before we can next take this action.
go-to: military_relations

@on_the_world_stage
choose-if: on_the_world_stage_timer <= 0
unavailable-subtitle: [+ on_the_world_stage_timer +] months before we can next take this action.
go-to: on_the_world_stage

@presidential_snap_election
go-to: presidential_snap_election

@reichsexekution
choose-if: reichsexekution_timer <= 0
unavailable-subtitle: [+ reichsexekution_timer +] months before we can next take this action.
